% technique v1

launder_towels :

A towel is about the most massively useful thing an interstellar hitchhiker
can have, so each one gets dried individually.

    1.  Gather the towels { ["blue", "green"] ~ towels }
    2.  { foreach towel in towels }
        -   <dry_towel>(towel)

dry_towel(towel) : Towel -> ()

    1.  Hang { towel } on the line
    2.  Wait for the sun
